{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_34","type":"agent_message","text":"The primary results already show a sharp frontier. The exact router is perfectly reliable only on its literal key and has zero distribution drift; unconstrained LoRA generalizes almost everywhere but collapses small-addition preservation, while paraphrase training plus locality rehearsal keeps 99.6% accuracy on 224 held-out sums with the same 100% exact and semantic success. Restricting updates to the last four layers did not confer locality. I’m now running the planned target-robustness checks and then will validate the statistics and write the report."}}
